---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE, LEGAL } from '../site.config.js';
---
<BaseLayout title="Terms of use" description="The terms that apply to using this site, including the important one about medical advice.">
  <main class="prose-page">
    <h1>Terms of use</h1>

    <h2>This is not medical advice</h2>
    <p>
      This is the term that matters most, so it comes first. {SITE.name} provides
      general educational information and estimates produced by published
      formulas. It does not provide medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment, and
      using it does not create any clinician–patient relationship.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Every number this site produces is an estimate with a margin of
      error</strong>, generated by an equation derived from a study population
      that may not resemble you. Body-fat methods, calorie equations, and weight
      ranges are screening and planning tools, not measurements of your health.
    </p>
    <p>
      Talk to a doctor or a registered dietitian before making significant changes
      to how you eat or train, and especially if you are pregnant, have a history
      of disordered eating, or manage any medical condition. If a result here
      conflicts with what a qualified professional has told you, follow the
      professional.
    </p>

    <h2>Who these tools are for</h2>
    <p>
      These calculators are built for adults aged 18 and over. The equations
      behind them were developed and validated on adult bodies and do not produce
      meaningful results for people who are still growing.
    </p>

    <h2>Accuracy, and what to do when we get it wrong</h2>
    <p>
      We work hard to source every formula and state its limitations, and we
      publish corrections rather than quietly editing. But we make no warranty
      that the site is error-free. If you spot a mistake, please report it — that
      is genuinely the fastest way this gets better.
    </p>

    <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>
      To the fullest extent permitted by law, {SITE.name} and its contributors are
      not liable for any loss or injury arising from use of this site or reliance
      on information found here. You use these tools at your own discretion and
      risk.
    </p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>
      This site is not directed at children and its tools are not appropriate for
      them. We do not knowingly collect information from anyone of any age,
      because we do not collect information at all.
    </p>

    <h2>Governing law</h2>
    <p>
      This site is operated from {LEGAL.country}. These terms are governed by the
      laws of the State of {LEGAL.state}, without regard to conflict-of-law rules.
      Nothing here limits any right you have under consumer-protection law that
      cannot be waived by agreement.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions, corrections, and error reports:{' '}
      <a href={`mailto:${LEGAL.contactEmail}`}>{LEGAL.contactEmail}</a>. Reporting
      a mistake in a formula is genuinely the most useful thing you can do here.
    </p>

    <h2>Content and code</h2>
    <p>
      Written content on this site is ours. The calculator code is open source
      under the terms stated in its repository. Cited studies belong to their
      authors and publishers; we link rather than reproduce.
    </p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
